 the Grand Elder in <Picture 1>, an elderly cultivator with white hair and beard, a dark-blue robe with gold patterns, a gold-and-teal crown, and a glowing golden longsword emitting golden runes.\n<Subject 2> is the Blood Demon in <Picture 2>, a tall woman with long red hair, black-and-red battle armor, a long crimson-and-black robe, and a crimson demonic sword.\n<Subject 3> is the dark chaotic void arena in both reference images, with a glowing circular formation, swirling dark mist, and floating golden or crimson particles.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> confronting each other in <Subject 3>. <Subject 1> unleashes \"万剑归宗\" with golden sword shadows and runes, while <Subject 2> releases crimson demonic energy. They charge and clash, ending in a gold-and-red energy explosion that fills the frame.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the white hair and beard, dark-blue gold-patterned robe, crown, and glowing golden longsword are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the long red hair, black-and-red battle armor, crimson robe, and crimson demonic sword are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the dark void arena, glowing circular formation, and swirling mist are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a 3A-game CG-style xianxia fantasy sequence with high-contrast cinematic lighting, motion blur, and particle-heavy VFX.\n[Shot 1] A wide, low-angle two-shot establishes <Subject 3>, the dark chaotic void arena with a glowing circular formation beneath the combatants. <Subject 1>, the Grand Elder with white hair, white beard, dark-blue gold-patterned robe, and gold-and-teal crown, stands on the left in a wide stance, his glowing golden longsword raised and trailing golden rune particles. <Subject 2>, the Blood Demon with long red hair, black-and-red battle armor, and crimson robe, stands on the right, her crimson demonic sword held low with a cold smirk at the corner of her mouth. The camera begins a fast semi-circular orbit around the pair while slowly dollying in. <Subject 1> snarls and swings his sword in a horizontal arc, summoning \"万剑归宗\": thousands of golden sword silhouettes materialize and spiral around his body, each edged with glowing runes. Simultaneously, <Subject 2> exhales a wave of crimson demonic energy that churns like a blood sea across the formation floor.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the camera continues its orbit and accelerates into a tight push-in on the two weapons as both figures lunge forward in a near-simultaneous charge. The golden longsword and the crimson demonic sword collide at the center of the frame in a violent impact, producing a sharp metallic shriek and a burst of gold-and-red sparks. The camera settles on an extreme close-up of the crossed blades, their edges vibrating with clashing energy.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.000, the impact point erupts into a twin-colored energy storm of golden true-qi and crimson killing-qi that expands radially, shredding the surrounding sword shadows and demonic mist. The camera pulls back rapidly to a wide establishing view, capturing the shockwave rolling outward across <Subject 3> and filling the entire frame with a blinding gold-and-red detonation.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA low, rumbling void ambience and the hiss of swirling mist continue throughout. The shot adds the whoosh of a sword swing, the shimmering chime of golden runes, the growl of crimson energy, a sharp metallic clack on blade impact, and a deep resonant explosion boom that rolls across the arena.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nAn epic orchestral score with fast-paced percussion, soaring strings, and low brass stabs, building in intensity from a tense sustained chord to a full-force climax at the energy explosion."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 14, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [448.7922668457031, 796.09375], "pos": [1125.8848876953125, 851.4037475585938], "id": 18, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [30], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["【核心主体与场景】\n大长老（白发白须，深蓝金纹长袍，手持散发金色符文的发光长剑）与血煞天魔（红发长裙，黑红战甲，手持猩红魔剑）在暗黑混沌的虚空法阵中对峙。\n\n【动作时间线 (0-5秒)】\n\n0-2秒：大长老怒目挥剑，施展“万剑归宗”，万千金色剑影伴随符文环绕周身。血煞天魔嘴角冷笑，猩红魔气如血海般翻涌。\n\n2-4秒：两人瞬间冲刺交锋，金色长剑与血色魔剑在空中剧烈碰撞。\n\n4-5秒：兵器交击处产生金红双色的能量风暴，瞬间炸裂席卷全屏。\n\n【运镜设计】\n环绕双人半圈快速拉近，推至双剑交击的局部特写，最后瞬间拉远展现能量爆炸的冲击波。\n\n【光影与特效】\n璀璨的金色真气与暗红色的猩红煞气形成极致色彩对比，漫天飞舞的金色符文与血色雾气交织，高对比度，电影级光影。\n\n【画风与质感】\n3A游戏CG级，仙侠玄幻风格，极高画质，史诗感，动感模糊，粒子特效，8K分辨率，光影追踪。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [404.5614013671875, 731.4037475585938], "pos": [925.9912109375, 0], "id": 34, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI", false], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "only_preview"}, "name": "only_preview", "label": "only_preview", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "only_preview"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy imageSave", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 82], "pos": [402.28082275390625, 851.4037475585938], "id": 46, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node n